<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues air and drone strikes in southern Lebanon, killing a Hezbollah operative, wounding another, and killing a civilian on a motorcycle while wounding a second. Hezbollah responds with artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun distributing its first cash payments to war victims and displaced families. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon due to the fighting. Israeli forces have also built a new road in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, a development not mentioned in the previous briefing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168713&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFB1VkUyUE9uVUE3REF1UmhLa1U1c3BraFlLR0IyNWRGQVZlUlpPOFlaRk5RVk5tMDdDZDl5U05OV2xoU0FpeDgzbVNvMmU5c05jV2dFdUZVYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUHBWcEdPQXpBSzB2REVhcUNjWkc2VzBELW1iRE9nQWhKV3MyQlkxQUFYVUUwYnVrci1nbEY5Nkw5UXdXQ0JXSGdCd3RJaHlVd3pjVkl0RzZUek04WElUcmNZWnFVQXJ1UVpOSVFFU3dpZDJHR19mdFZTSmo2TDM4c0x3SXZtYmU4TmM5cWZYcGxjdlVMbmszN2NWek5Nb1c5X0hhNWw4TEMyOHZET3VfUmU0WDZtRk5ER1lOdTZiVTNnRUhnd0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNWG4xVnQyTGV3M2d4Y19NeTY3a0pVbTJxVk52VzMxR0E2YkUyNlNzc1dYc2tGeW9KQ3l3eEpvbE1LOHhueXdhcnZCam9vN29HWXdRcnkxVHdLLVpRUmo3bGc5a0lyM3FGSjFnaWtxYkJweUFLVVVaUEtuOWstejZqaTNzanR1M1h6bVVlbTJUcjJYTFFpS0VtdDFHWm0zTE9IdlZsUjJ1VGZtTV9LUUt6SElGWmlzbzFSOU1mdXNrODJPa1JrX3FUbVRJblE?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Upper Michigan's Source&lt;/a&gt;